   <h2 id="social-title">Built from day one.<br />A story worth sharing.</h2>
   <p>I opened my fraternity’s Instagram account and have managed it since day one. Over four academic years and more than 100 posts, I’ve shared our brotherhood, promoted fundraisers, and told our chapter’s story.</p>
   <div class="social-achievement"><strong>50,379</strong><span>views in 30 days</span></div>
   <p>Seeing the account pass 50,000 views in a single month is a milestone I’m especially proud of. It reflects a side of my leadership that I’ve built through consistent, hands-on work: creating content, communicating with an audience, and giving our chapter a public voice.</p>
   <dl class="social-stats"><div><dt>73.3%</dt><dd>of views from non-followers</dd></div><div><dt>100+</dt><dd>posts published</dd></div><div><dt>4</dt><dd>academic years managing the account</dd></div></dl>
   <p class="social-context">My chapter involvement has included Founding President, GMC, Brotherhood and Fundraising Chair, Scribe, and other chair and committee responsibilities. Managing our account has been a consistent thread through that experience.</p><a class="text-link instagram-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/uhartkapsig/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chapter Instagram · @uhartkapsig ↗</a>
